llowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T09:57:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T10:04:55Z","body":"> `SNAME` construction is approximately 2.4% faster (1,066 usec improvement over 10 million iterations) . Could this be noise?\r\n\r\nIt could be! For benchmarks you should usually strive make the benchmark hard enough to take around ~1 second. With `SNAME` this might be difficult since this may mean millions of unique `SNAME` instances.\r\n\r\nIn either case, since the difference is only ~1us over 10 million iterations, it sounds like this change may only save 0.5ns in total for engine startup (note: this sounds like an underestimation, but either way I do expect the number to be very small). I don't think it is worth it to add new code for it in this light.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3789416232/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]